#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/TraversableNavigable.cpp lines 1-375 (the constructor,
#       visit_edges, the user agent's top-level traversable set, creating a new top-level browsing
#       context and document, creating a new and a fresh top-level traversable,
#       is_top_level_traversable, the used history steps, the history object's length and index,
#       the used step, and the three navigable sets of a traversal), with the inline functions of
